OL,3,GNEWSAPrint commissioned by Nasa
OL,4,Auncovered for exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA print by a Yorkshire artist
OL,7,Fcommissioned by Nasa in the early days
OL,8,Fof space travel will go on show as part
OL,9,Fof a pop art exhibition.
OL,11,FKomtek I by Michael Fossick, who
OL,12,Fstudied at Bradford School of Art, was
OL,13,Fcreated in 1962 to celebrate a Hong
OL,14,FKong company that produced
OL,15,Fmicrocomputers in the early days of
OL,16,Fspace travel.
OL,18,FThe print was part of a Nasa project to
OL,19,Fdocument the effort of sending the
OL,20,Ffirst humans to the moon and is on
OL,21,Fdisplay as part of the Pop Art at
OL,22,FCartwright Hall exhibition.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
